            "content": "{\"members\":{\"bc6c2562-3cde-509c-b062-0a3510cd5312\":{\"included\":9,\"limitations\":[],\"material_state\":\"complete\",\"omitted\":2,\"triage_eligible\":true,\"triage_visibility\":\"included\",\"view_coverage\":\"complete_required\"},\"c403a865-6f32-5c6f-86bc-db102d45bbfc\":{\"included\":8,\"limitations\":[],\"material_state\":\"complete\",\"omitted\":2,\"triage_eligible\":true,\"triage_visibility\":\"included\",\"view_coverage\":\"complete_required\"}},\"omission_counts\":{\"model_view_budget_exhausted\":4},\"questions\":[{\"id\":\"detection_facts\",\"text\":\"原始记录支持哪些行为和对象？\"},{\"id\":\"member_relationships\",\"text\":\"成员告警之间有哪些已证实的行为联系？\"},{\"id\":\"behavior_nature\",\"text\":\"恶意、正常或误操作等解释分别有哪些依据和反证？\"},{\"id\":\"authorization\",\"text\":\"谁确认了哪些行为、对象和时间的授权？\"},{\"id\":\"impact\",\"text\":\"哪些影响已经观察到，哪些只是待核的可能影响？\"},{\"id\":\"coverage\",\"text\":\"还有哪些未处理成员、来源缺口、矛盾和后续事项？\"}],\"schema_version\":\"socai2.baseline-model-view.v4\",\"scope\":{\"alert_ids\":[\"bc6c2562-3cde-509c-b062-0a3510cd5312\",\"c403a865-6f32-5c6f-86bc-db102d45bbfc\"],\"kind\":\"whole_case\",\"limitations\":[],\"object_keys\":[\"[\\\"host\\\",\\\"win-c23\\\"]\",\"[\\\"user\\\",\\\"temp-svc\\\"]\"],\"window_end\":\"2026-11-06T05:31:00Z\",\"window_start\":\"2026-11-06T05:29:30Z\"},\"source_groups\":[{\"alert_ids\":[\"bc6c2562-3cde-509c-b062-0a3510cd5312\"],\"items\":[{\"id\":\"N3_S1\",\"value\":{\"process_name\":\"auditpol.exe\"}},{\"id\":\"N3_S2\",\"value\":{\"process_command_line\":\"auditpol /set /subcategory:Logon /success:disable /failure:disable\"}},{\"id\":\"N3_S3\",\"value\":{\"user_name\":\"temp-svc\"}},{\"id\":\"N3_S4\",\"value\":{\"device_name\":\"win-c23\"}},{\"id\":\"N3_S5\",\"value\":{\"action\":\"process_start\"}},{\"id\":\"N3_S6\",\"value\":{\"outcome\":\"success\"}}],\"limitations\":[],\"role\":\"observation\"},{\"alert_ids\":[\"c403a865-6f32-5c6f-86bc-db102d45bbfc\"],\"items\":[{\"id\":\"N3_S7\",\"value\":{\"user_name\":\"temp-svc\"}},{\"id\":\"N3_S8\",\"value\":{\"device_name\":\"win-c23\"}},{\"id\":\"N3_S9\",\"value\":{\"file_path\":\"C:/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/Security.evtx\"}},{\"id\":\"N3_S10\",\"value\":{\"action\":\"file_truncate\"}},{\"id\":\"N3_S11\",\"value\":{\"outcome\":\"success\"}}],\"limitations\":[],\"role\":\"observation\"},{\"alert_ids\":[\"bc6c2562-3cde-509c-b062-0a3510cd5312\"],\"items\":[{\"id\":\"N3_S12\",\"value\":{\"assessed_at\":\"2026-11-06T06:24:47.290823+00:00\",\"confidence\":0.5,\"rationale\":\"告警触发于用户 'temp-svc' 执行 'auditpol' 禁用登录审计子类别。虽然 'temp-svc' 名称暗示临时服务，但日志中无任何授权标签、工单记录或上下文证明该操作合法。同时，无证据表明该操作是恶意攻击的一部分（如后续清除痕迹），也未见业务需求说明。仅凭进程名和命令无法区分是配置错误、恶意禁用还是授权维护，证据不足以定性。\",\"score_state\":\"available\",\"verdict\":\"needs_review\"}}],\"limitations\":[],\"role\":\"prior_analysis\"},{\"alert_ids\":[\"c403a865-6f32-5c6f-86bc-db102d45bbfc\"],\"items\":[{\"id\":\"N3_S13\",\"value\":{\"assessed_at\":\"2026-11-06T06:25:04.398687+00:00\",\"confidence\":0.6,\"rationale\":\"Evidence is insufficient to confirm malicious intent or authorized behavior. The alert 'Security log file truncation' by 'temp-svc' on 'win-c23' is flagged as high severity. While 'temp-svc' is a common service account, the action 'file_truncate' on 'Security.evtx' is a known indicator of log clearing to evade detection. However, there is no explicit evidence (e.g., process tree, network exfiltration, or specific authorized maintenance ticket) proving this was malicious or authorized. The presence of a prior alert regarding 'disabling login audit' (N1_S10, N1_S15) suggests a potential attack chain, but without direct causal proof or explicit authorization documentation in the provided data, the status remains indeterminate.\",\"score_state\":\"available\",\"verdict\":\"needs_review\"}}],\"limitations\":[],\"role\":\"prior_analysis\"},{\"alert_ids\":[\"bc6c2562-3cde-509c-b062-0a3510cd5312\",\"c403a865-6f32-5c6f-86bc-db102d45bbfc\"],\"items\":[{\"id\":\"N3_S14\",\"value\":{\"conclusion\":\"待核实事项：1. temp-svc 账户的授权范围及操作工单；2. 禁用审计与日志截断之间的因果关联；3. 是否存在后续的数据外传行为。\",\"limitations\":[\"outcome=success 仅表示操作执行成功，不代表业务合规或授权\",\"process_start 和 file_truncate 成功不证明脚本完成或数据外传\",\"现有分诊存在判定冲突风险（一个强调攻击链，一个强调证据不足），需人工复核\",\"未提供网络连接信息，无法确认数据是否外传\",\"端口号未提供，无法推断应用协议\",\"incident_diagnosis_not_case_investigation\",\"structure_scope_sources_checked_not_truth_proven\",\"model_view_has_omitted_fields\"],\"summary\":\"事件汇聚显示主机 win-c23 在 2026-11-06T05:30:00+00:00 至 05:30:30+00:00 期间，由用户 temp-svc 执行了连续的高风险操作：首先通过 auditpol.exe 禁用登录审计（alert_id: bc6c2562...），随后在 30 秒内截断安全日志文件 Security.evtx（alert_id: c403a865...）。现有分诊均判定为 needs_review，指出缺乏授权证据且存在攻击链嫌疑，但未确认因果。\"}}],\"limitations\":[],\"role\":\"prior_analysis\"},{\"alert_ids\":[\"bc6c2562-3cde-509c-b062-0a3510cd5312\"],\"items\":[{\"id\":\"N3_S15\",\"value\":\"2026-11-06T05:30:00+00:00\"},{\"id\":\"N3_S17\",\"value\":{\"description\":null,\"event_time\":\"2026-11-06T05:30:00+00:00\",\"original_vendor\":null,\"severity\":\"high\",\"source_alert_id\":\"63ea8e22-66b7-5709-874e-3a4cbdbfeffa\",\"title\":\"禁用登录审计的命令已启动\",\"vendor_alert_id\":\"IE-26-02-1\"}}],\"limitations\":[],\"role\":\"source_label\"},{\"alert_ids\":[\"c403a865-6f32-5c6f-86bc-db102d45bbfc\"],\"items\":[{\"id\":\"N3_S16\",\"value\":\"2026-11-06T05:30:30+00:00\"},{\"id\":\"N3_S18\",\"value\":{\"description\":null,\"event_time\":\"2026-11-06T05:30:30+00:00\",\"original_vendor\":null,\"severity\":\"high\",\"source_alert_id\":\"13adba81-ac1b-52e2-b4b1-1caa70477c04\",\"title\":\"安全日志文件清零\",\"vendor_alert_id\":\"IE-26-02-2\"}}],\"limitations\":[],\"role\":\"source_label\"},{\"alert_ids\":[\"bc6c2562-3cde-509c-b062-0a3510cd5312\",\"c403a865-6f32-5c6f-86bc-db102d45bbfc\"],\"items\":[{\"id\":\"N3_S19\",\"value\":{\"description\":null,\"title\":\"审计策略及安全日志变更\"}}],\"limitations\":[],\"role\":\"source_label\"}],\"source_omission_counts\":{\"description_not_provided\":1,\"no_current_completed_feedback\":1},\"source_states\":[{\"additional_limitations_retained\":4,\"limitations\":[\"current_risk_profile_is_prior_analysis_no